lawsuit, neither of them are particularly

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:36.389
attractive.

00:07:36.389 --> 00:07:41.139
They're not good guys in Karmon common parlance.

00:07:41.139 --> 00:07:52.060
But through a just a bizarre set of circumstances,
the defendant in the case became aware that

00:07:52.060 --> 00:08:00.479
