00:08:11.879 --> 00:08:12.879
Right.

00:08:12.879 --> 00:08:20.449
Well, after this case was decided, it was
so it was subsequently uncovered by a group

00:08:20.449 --> 00:08:27.639
of Internet activists what the likely source
of the hack material was, who had done the

00:08:27.639 --> 00:08:28.639
hacking.

00:08:28.639 --> 00:08:33.960
And this individual then went out and retained
his own private investigator to dig into this

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:40.460
and is now constructing a case to expose the
hacking that went on against him.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:47.440
And so, you know, there are many situations
where the use of a private investigator, private

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:55.060
spy, to defend yourself, to go and uncover
wrongdoing that has been taking place against

00:08:55.060 --> 00:09:01.030
you by a government or by an individual actor,
private actor is more than justified.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:09.200
Speaker 1: If you want to think about the
way that journalists, as well as the media

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:14.490
