Just to be clear, just so the audience you
met, you have done it.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.020
You said Donald Steele, you met Donald Trump.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.210
Speaker 5: Donald Trump.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.210
Right.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:18.280
And Christopher Steele, MI6 agent, was hired
to basically gather dirt on Donald Trump in

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.630
